        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note-0" value="&lt;b&gt;SUP-01 / HND-01&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Customer Care works only on assigned requests; ESCALATED goes to a Manager who records a decision and returns it. Responses are kept as history. A Sale requests handover only for an owned Customer; one PENDING request per Customer; nothing changes until a Manager approves. SALES type: target is a Sale with an ACTIVE assignment for the related Offering. CARE type: target is Customer Care and approval creates a care assignment. All transitions are audited." style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fillColor=#F3F6FA;strokeColor=#C7D2DE;fontSize=14;fontColor=#24384C;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="940" y="900" width="1240" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
